[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2784206627","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105047#issuecomment-2784206627","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105047","id":2784206627,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6l858j","user":{"login":"orlambda","id":115938017,"node_id":"U_kgDOBukS4Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115938017?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/orlambda","html_url":"https://github.com/orlambda","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/orlambda/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/orlambda/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/orlambda/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/orlambda/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/orlambda/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/orlambda/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/orlambda/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/orlambda/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/orlambda/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-07T18:26:59Z","updated_at":"2025-04-29T22:45:53Z","body":"I've replicated this on macOS 14.4.1 with a PS5 controller, wired.\n\nInput.get_action_strength() returns 1 after the controller is disconnected regardless of whether the joystick is deflected at that point. So even if it's outputting 0, it will start outputting 1 when the controller is disconnected.\n\nI'm happy to work on this.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2784206627/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2840417137","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105047#issuecomment-2840417137","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105047","id":2840417137,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6pTVNx","user":{"login":"orlambda","id":115938017,"node_id":"U_kgDOBukS4Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115938017?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/orlambda","html_url":"https://github.com/orlambda","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/orlambda/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/orlambda/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/orlambda/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/orlambda/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/orlambda/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/orlambda/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/orlambda/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/orlambda/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/orlambda/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-29T22:56:48Z","updated_at":"2025-04-29T22:56:48Z","body":"It looks like what I'm observing on macOS 14 is related but different so I'll probably create a new issue for that when I can define it more precisely. It may be that one fix covers both these cases. The exact behaviour varies with different operating systems and controllers, so this could do with being tested on a variety of platforms. \n\nI think I'm close to a fix. I'll post more soon when I have a clearer understanding.\n\n\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2840417137/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repo